Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So if you are considering going into experimental physics...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们考虑进入实验物理学界
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...my door is always open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我永远欢迎大家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:08.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Again, I'm sorry that the demonstration didn't quite work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:08.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很抱歉示范失败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:09.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now we know what happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:09.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都知道不小心将蜜桃汁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:13.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when you accidentally spill peach Snapple into a helium-neon laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.59,0:00:13.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泼在氦氖激光上会发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The short answer is don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简单地来说就是“不要”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:24.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now to tell you about the Theoretical Physics Department...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:24.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为大家介绍理论物理学系的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is Dr. Sheldon Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谢尔顿库珀博士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Cooper? SHELDON: Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-库珀博士？ -算了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, we both agreed to do this. SHELDON: It's a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我们说好了 -这是在浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I might as well explain thermodynamics to a bunch of Labradoodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我宁愿跟一群拉布拉多解释热力学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:50.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't do this, I won't take you to the comic-book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.09,0:00:50.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不这么做 我就不带你去漫画书店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:54.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:54.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:01.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice work with the laser, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:01.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 激光那招不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:06.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Looking out at your fresh young faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:06.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看到你们天真年轻的脸庞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:09.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I remember when I too was deciding my academic future...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:09.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想起仍在决定未来的我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:12.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as a lowly graduate student.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:12.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那时我还是研究院一年级新生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, I was 14...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然我才14岁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:18.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and had achieved more than you could ever hope to...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}成就远远超过你们的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...despite my 9:00 bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我九点就得上床睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:25.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, there may be one or two of you in this room who has what it takes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你们之中有一两个人真的有天分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to succeed in theoretical physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在理论物理学界弄出点名堂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's more likely that you will spend your careers teaching fifth graders...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.26,0:01:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但多数人一辈子只能教五年级学生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:35.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...how to make papier-mâché volcanoes with baking-soda lava.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:35.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如何用纸做出火山 加上小苏打粉熔岩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.14,0:01:38.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.14,0:01:38.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:41.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In short, anyone who told you that you would someday be able...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.56,0:01:41.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简单地来说 如果有人跟你们说某天你们可以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:45.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to make any significant contribution to physics played a trick on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:45.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对物理学做出卓越贡献 那都是骗你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A cruel trick indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是非常残忍的恶作剧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:51.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:51.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.58,0:01:59.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I weep for the future of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.58,0:01:59.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为科学界的未来感到悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:02.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, if you'll excuse me, the latest issue of Batman is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:02.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 最新一期的《蝙蝠侠》要出刊了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快来吧 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:11.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Laser demonstration's looking pretty good now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:11.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你们觉得激光示范还不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:36.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love this time of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:36.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢每年的这个季节
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:39.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The leaves are turning. There's a bracing chill in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:39.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}树叶变红 空气中带着凉意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:42.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus, there's a whole new crop of female grad students...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:42.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且有一群新来的女研究生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:46.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...about to put on just enough winter weight to make them needy and vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:46.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打算囤积足够的脂肪过冬 这让她们变得依赖又脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.17,0:02:52.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right, honey, have another calzone. Daddy can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.17,0:02:52.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 甜心 再吃块起司烤饼 我愿意等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:58.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't there a policy against dating graduate students?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:58.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟研究生约会不是违反校规吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. If you can talk to them, you can ask them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 如果你可以跟她们说话 就可以约她们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:02.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn. There's always a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:02.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死 我就知道一定有漏洞可钻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, guys. -Hey, Leslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大家好 -莱斯丽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:09.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, dumb-ass, I heard you made a grad student throw up last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:09.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}笨蛋 听说昨晚你害研究生吐了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:14.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The truth can indeed be a finger down the throat of those unprepared to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:14.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实应该是把手指伸进还没有准备好的 学生喉咙里催吐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:17.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But why should I cater to second-rate minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:17.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么我要跟笨蛋解释呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.95,0:03:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because first-rate minds call you "dumb-ass."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.95,0:03:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为天才骂你“笨蛋”？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah? Well--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a mean person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你太没有礼貌了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:29.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, Dr. Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:29.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 库珀博士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:32.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Ramona Nowitzki. I was at your talk last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:32.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是雷梦娜诺维斯基 昨晚我有上你的课
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:37.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I think you're just brilliant. -Well, that is the prevailing opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:37.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我觉得你很聪明 -大家都那么说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, now I'm gonna throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 我快吐了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:42.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard Wolowitz, Department of Engineering...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:42.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德沃洛维茨 工程系
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...co-designer of the International Space Station's liquid-waste-disposal system.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我设计了国际太空站液态废弃物处理系统
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:51.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Cooper, I've read everything you've published.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库珀博士 我读过你出版的所有论文
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:04:00.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I liked your paper on grand unification using string-network condensates...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:04:00.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢你用弦网路浓缩物解释大一统的论文
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and was wondering how you determined that three-dimensional string nets...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也很纳闷你会如何解释立体弦网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...provided a unified picture of fermions and gauge bosons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}提供一致的费密子跟规范玻色子说明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:10.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Amazing. An intelligent Labradoodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:07.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}聪明的拉布拉多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Woof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The fact is, I'm quite close to a breakthrough...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上我即将有所突破
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in showing how neutrinos emerge from a string-net condensate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}证明微中子如何从弦网浓缩中出现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:23.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. That would change the way we view the entire physical universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:23.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 那将会改变我们对物理学的看法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那正是我要做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:29.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, the Pishkin-Wolowitz liquid-waste-disposal system...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:29.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？皮希金沃洛维茨液态废弃物处理系统
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:32.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is turning a few heads as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:32.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也让一些人很惊艳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:38.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Again, ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:38.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I'd love to hear more about how you intend to add neutrinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很想听听你打算如何诠释微中子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:46.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Could we get a cup of coffee sometime? -I don't drink coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:46.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们可以一起喝杯咖啡吗？ -我不喝咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do. I love me a cup of Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会喝咖啡 我爱死咖啡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't have to be coffee. How about dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不一定要喝咖啡 吃晚餐呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I do eat dinner. -Great. I know a terrific little Italian place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:55.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我会吃晚餐 -太棒了 有家意大利小馆不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:59.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I never eat in strange restaurants. One runs the risk of non-standard cutlery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:59.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在陌生的餐厅吃饭 很可能会出现不符标准的餐具
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:05.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Excuse me? -Sheldon lives in fear of the three-tined fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:05.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你说什么？ -谢尔顿害怕三叉式的叉子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:08.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three tines is not a fork. Three tines is a trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叉子不该是三叉设计 三叉戟才该有三叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:13.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forks are for eating, tridents are for ruling the seven seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:13.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叉子是拿来吃东西用的 三叉戟被用来征服七海
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:17.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What if I brought food to your place? -That would be acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:17.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-如果我带东西到你家吃呢？ -我可以接受
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On Mondays, I eat Thai food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}星期一我吃泰餐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:23.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mee Krob and chicken satay with extra peanut sauce from Siam Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}暹罗皇宫的泰式炒面跟多加花生酱的鸡肉沙爹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:26.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got it. I already have your address.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:26.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题 我已经知道你的住址
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:31.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:31.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是个好女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:35.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, do you have any idea what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:35.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你知道发生了什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. Apparently, I'm getting a free dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 显然我可以吃到免费的晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:46.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, no, this thing's majorly out of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:46.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 不 电梯坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-See? I'm sorry. -Okay. Guess I'm taking the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-看吧 对不起 -好吧 看来我得走楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:52.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where you going? -Four-A.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:52.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要找谁？ -4A
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:55.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, are you here to see Leonard? -No, Dr. Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:55.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你来找莱纳德？ -不 库珀博士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Sheldon Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿库珀博士？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:01.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're having dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:01.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要一起吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:03.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:03.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿库珀？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:09.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tall, thin, looks a little like a giant praying mantis?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:09.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}高大 削瘦 长得有点像螳螂？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He is cute, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他很可爱 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Sheldon Cooper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿库珀？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, Leonard. -Hey, Ramona. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 -雷梦娜 请进
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks. Where should I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 我该把食物放在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:26.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-The kitchen's fine. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:26.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-放在厨房就可以了 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:29.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. What are you doing? -I need to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在做什么？ -我得目赌这一幕才行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:30.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:34.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The viewing area's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:34.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}观众席在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:39.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, your girl-- Date-- Person-- Ramona's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:39.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你的女孩…女伴…约的人…雷梦娜来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.78,0:06:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hello. -Oh, sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.78,0:06:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -抱歉我迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:46.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got caught up reading the draft of your latest paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:46.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看你的最新论文草稿看到入迷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:50.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you enjoy the footnote where I illustrate mirror symmetry by likening it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:50.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你喜欢我写的附注吗？我画了一个小倒影 看起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:52.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...to The Flash playing tennis with himself? -So funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:53.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-像是闪电侠在跟自己打网球 -那真的很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:53.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The idea that you might be able to incorporate gravity...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你是想要解释重力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:07:01.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I have to tell you, I found it physically exhilarating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:07:01.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得跟你说我觉得通体舒泰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:05.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My hypotheses tend to have that effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:05.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的假设就是想要有那样的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:09.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry I didn't bring enough for your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我没帮你的朋友们准备晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:12.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I assumed we were going to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:12.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为只有我们两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:17.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Yeah. No, we were just going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:19.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 不 我们要走了 -我们要看他们 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:19.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To watch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. Come on now. We're going out. -Oh, come on. We'll be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 来吧 我们要出去了 -少来了 我们会很安静的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:26.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:26.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:29.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:29.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:34.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just have a nice whatever this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:34.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好好玩 不论你们要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:42.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you guys, look, I know this is none of my business, but I just-- I have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:42.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 听着 这不关我的事 但我真的得问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:44.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's Sheldon's deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:44.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿喜欢什么类型？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:51.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you mean, "deal"? -You know, like, what's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:51.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你是什么意思？ -他喜欢什么类型？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:54.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it girls? Guys? Sock puppets?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:54.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女生？男生？袜子布偶？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:59.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honestly, we've been operating under the assumption that he has no deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:59.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说真的 我们不认为他有喜欢的类型
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, come on, everybody has a deal. -Not Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-少来了 每个人都有喜欢的类型 -谢尔顿不会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Over the years, we've formulated many theories about how he might reproduce.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多年来我们想出许多理论说明他会如何繁殖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm an advocate of mitosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我支持细胞有丝分裂论
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:13.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:13.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe, one day, Sheldon will eat an enormous amount of Thai food...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信有一天 谢尔顿会吃下大量的泰餐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:20.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and split into two Sheldons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:20.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}分裂成两个谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:25.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On the other hand, I think Sheldon might be the larval form of his species.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:25.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另一方面我认为谢尔顿或许是同种生物的幼虫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:27.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'll spin a cocoon and emerge two months later...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:27.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他会吐丝做成茧 两个月后破蛹而出
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:30.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with moth wings and an exoskeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:30.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}长出飞蛾的翅膀跟外壳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, thanks for the nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢谢你们提供的恶梦素材
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:39.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, do you wanna hang out with us? -Well, what are you guys gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:39.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要跟我们一起出去吗？ -你们要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:42.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:44.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mom's making a brisket tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:44.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚我妈要炖牛胸肉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-The one with the little onions? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-她会加小洋葱吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'm busy. So good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很忙 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Her loss. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是她的损失 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:03.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Brisket party. B to the R to the I-S-K.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:03.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}牛胸肉派对 牛啊 胸啊 还有肉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To the E to the T to the....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一起来派对…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Ooh-- -Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别唱了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:17.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey. Aren't you having breakfast? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:17.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你不吃早餐吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:21.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you experimenting with nutritional suppositories again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:21.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又在实验营养栓剂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:25.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not in these pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:25.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}穿这条裤子时不会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:30.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So how'd it go with Ramona last night? -Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:30.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-昨晚你跟雷梦娜还好吧？ -好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:32.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's smart, insightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:32.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她聪明 有远见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:36.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She has a very unique way of, you know, revering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:36.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能用非常独特的方式了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:43.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Here's your spinach-mushroom omelet. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:43.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你的菠菜蘑菇蛋卷来了 -谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:47.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Did anyone touch it? -Gloves were worn by everyone involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.38,0:09:47.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有人碰过它吗？ -相关人士都戴了手套
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:48.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:48.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我非常小心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:52.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ramona pointed out that I've been wasting 20 minutes a day...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:52.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}雷梦娜指出我每天浪费二十分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:54.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...standing on cafeteria lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:54.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}站在餐厅里排队
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:58.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Time which would be better spent tackling the great physics problems of our day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.14,0:09:58.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些时间最好用来处理现在物理学界的大问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:02.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't tackle the big issues, Ramona. You fence with them. En garde. Riposte.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:10:03.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大问题不能处理 雷梦娜 你只能挑战它们 来吧 放马过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.73,0:10:04.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:09.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Touché.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:09.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Morning. -Oh, hey, Leslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-早安 -莱斯丽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:14.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I see you're organizing your papers...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:14.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来你在为史密森尼博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:17.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for the Smithsonian Museum of Dumb-Assery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:17.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}笨蛋大展准备你的论文
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There won't be any room until they get rid of the permanent Leslie Winkle exhibit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会有展出空间 因为他们删除了莱斯丽温克展
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说得好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:29.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see you got a grad student to fight your battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.79,0:10:29.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看起来你让研究生帮你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:32.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll let you keep your lunch money today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:32.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天我就不跟你勒索午餐费了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:35.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Dr. Cooper is on the verge of a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:35.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 库珀博士即将做出大突破
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:38.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're going to stay, you'll have to be respectful and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:38.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想留下来 就得放尊重点 保持安静
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:48.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:48.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So have you worked out the neutrino issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你研究过微中子问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, to paraphrase Mozart, all the subatomic particles are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就跟莫札特一样 所有的次原子粒子都在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:11:01.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I just have to put them in the right order. -You're so witty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:11:01.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我只要将它们排列出来 -你好聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:10.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys, this package came for....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:10.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大伙 这个包裹是给…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:17.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Cooper is working. -Yes, I'm close to a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-库珀博士在工作 -对 我即将做出大突破
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:19.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh! Tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:19.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好痒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:23.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:23.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:30.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Holy crap on a cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:30.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:34.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Penny. -Hi. You probably don't wanna go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:34.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 -或许你不该进去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.78,0:11:36.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？他们在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, the only way I could explain it would be in a therapist's office with dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有在心理医生的办公室抱着娃娃 我才能说出这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:52.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:52.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:57.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Cooper's working. -Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:57.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-库珀博士在工作 -我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, Halo night, Koothrappali's. You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 《光晕》之夜 库萨帕里家 要来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:04.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yes, it's Halo night. Let me just dry my tootsies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:04.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 今晚是《光晕》之夜 让我把脚擦干
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:08.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're not going to Halo night. -Yes, I am. It's Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:08.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你不能参加《光晕》之夜 -不 我要 今天是星期三
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wednesday's Halo night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}星期三是《光晕》之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Didn't a great man once say, "Science demands nothing less...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:14.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是有个伟人曾说过 “科学唯一的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:18.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...than the fervent and unconditional dedication of our entire lives"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:18.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是热情跟终生无条件的付出”吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:21.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He did. -And who was that great man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:21.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没错 -那个伟人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:24.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:24.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sorry, Leonard. -Seriously? You're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:28.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-抱歉 莱纳德 -你真的不去？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You heard her. How can I argue with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你听到她说的话了 我怎么可以质疑自己呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, once again, you guys have a good...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 再次祝你们玩得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:39.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...whatever this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:39.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不论你们要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:45.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Cooper, I have to tell you, your friends are holding you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.47,0:12:45.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库珀博士 我得告诉你 你的朋友成了你的负担
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I prefer to think of it as I'm pulling them forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为我得带着他们前进
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.73,0:12:50.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Halo night?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.73,0:12:50.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《光晕》之夜？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:53.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A man with your intellectual gifts doesn't waste an evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:53.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像你这样的天才不该把晚上的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:55.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...playing video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:55.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}浪费在打游戏上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He does on Wednesdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他星期三就会那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:13:00.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not if he wants a Nobel Prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:13:00.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他不想拿诺贝尔奖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:02.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He does want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:02.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他很想拿诺贝尔奖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:08.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does a man with my intellectual gifts play paintball on weekends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.95,0:13:08.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像我这样的天才周末能玩漆弹游戏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you think? -Drat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你觉得呢？ -该死
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:17.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Now, shall we get back to work? -I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:17.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们可以继续工作了吗？ -应该可以
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:21.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Battlestar Galactica comes on tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:21.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚要演《银河战星》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:25.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess I can wait for the DVD.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:25.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我可以等着看DVD
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:29.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then never, ever watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:29.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是永远不要看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:54.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（《蝙蝠侠》）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:31.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny. Penny. Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:31.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:34.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, honey, I've told you, it's a small apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:34.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我跟你说过 这间公寓很小
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You only have to knock one-- -I don't have a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你只要敲一次… -我的时间不多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:41.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, Ramona finally dozed off, and I need you to help me get rid of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:41.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 雷梦娜终于睡着了 我需要你帮我赶走她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get rid of her how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要怎么赶走她？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, but, apparently, I'm in some kind of relationship...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 显然我陷入某种关系里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:53.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and, well, you seem to be an expert at ending them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:53.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你似乎是分手高手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.15,0:14:58.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.15,0:14:58.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:01.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see man after man leaving this apartment never to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.44,0:15:01.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到男人一个个地离开这间公寓 永远不再回来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.94,0:15:05.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, first of all, it is not man after man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.94,0:15:05.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 首先男人不是一个个地离开我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAMONA: Dr. Cooper? -Hide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-库珀博士？ -把我藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:12.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hide you? -I formally request sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:12.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-把你藏起来？ -我正式要求庇护
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why aren't you working?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.95,0:15:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么你没在工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:16.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:19.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She distracted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:19.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她让我分心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:22.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told you, I don't have time for your nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:22.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你说过我没空听你胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:25.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have important things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:25.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有重要的事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:30.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, man. -I know what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:30.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-天啊 -我知道发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Well, then will you explain it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？你能跟我解释吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.72,0:15:35.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're in love with Dr. Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.72,0:15:35.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你爱上了库珀博士
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, yeah, no, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't try to deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别想否认
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a remarkable man, but you have to let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是个伟人 但你得放他离开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:48.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, gee. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:48.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.99,0:15:53.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know it's hard, but he's a gift to the whole world, and we can't be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.99,0:15:53.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道这很难 但他有天分 必须改变世界 我们不能自私
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he's a gift, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 他有天分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好姐妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:04.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, sisters. Heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:04.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 好姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:06.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:06.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Holy crap on a cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[TAPPING ON WALL]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you doing? SHELDON: It's Morse code.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在做什么？ -这是摩斯密码
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:36.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -So we can communicate through the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:36.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -这样我们才能隔墙沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are communicating through the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们正在隔墙沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:43.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but the communication is not encrypted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:43.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但我们的沟通没有加密
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't know Morse code. -Oh, it's very simple. This is A.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不会摩斯密码 -它非常简单
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON KNOCKING ON WALL]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是A
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:50.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is B.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:50.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是B
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.22,0:16:52.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-This is C. -I'm not going to learn Morse code...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.22,0:16:52.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是C -我不想学摩斯密码
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:53.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at 3:00 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:53.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在是凌晨三点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:55.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:55.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:59.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't come in here. Don't come in here. Don't come in here. Don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:17:00.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别过来…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:07.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's going on? -Shh. Ramona's sleeping on the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:07.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-发生了什么事？ -雷梦娜在沙发上睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:11.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I know. When is she going home? -Never. That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:11.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我知道 她何时才会回家？ -永远不会了 这就是问题所在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:14.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I need your help. -What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:14.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我需要你帮忙 -你在胡说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm invoking the Skynet clause of our friendship agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要行使和约中的天网条款
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That only applies if you need me to help you destroy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那只适用于你发明的人工智能物即将占领地球的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...an artificial intelligence you created that's taking over the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮你摧毁它
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:28.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, don't nitpick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.71,0:17:28.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得了吧 别太吹毛求疵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:32.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good night. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:32.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-晚安 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:36.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm invoking our Body Snatchers clause.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:36.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要行使我们的绑架人体条款
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Body Snatchers clause requires me to help destroy someone we know...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绑架人体条款是要我帮忙摧毁我们认识的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who's been replaced with an alien pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她必须遭到外星人附身
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:44.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. She's in the living room. Go. I'll wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.77,0:17:44.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 她在客厅里 快去吧 我在这里等你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:49.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, what are you doing out of bed? -Now. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:49.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 为什么你不在睡觉？ -快动手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.99,0:17:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You need your sleep for your cognitive processing to perform at optimum levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.99,0:17:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要好好睡觉才能将大脑能力发挥到极致
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Now, come on. -Godzilla clause?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-快来吧 -哥斯拉条款？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Not unless she destroys Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非她要摧毁东京
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:06.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:06.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:09.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I finally reconciled the black hole information paradox...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:09.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我终于解开了黑洞信息悖论
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:12.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with my theory of string-network condensates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:12.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用我的弦网路浓缩理论解释一切
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:17.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's unbelievable. It's paradigm-altering. -And I could not have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:17.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不可思议 那是个惊人的改变 -没有你的帮忙 我是办不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:20.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I just offered a little encouragement. -You did a lot more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.39,0:18:20.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我只是给了你一点鼓励 -你的功劳不只是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You helped me work out the masses of the fermions...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你帮我解开了费密子质量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:25.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you pumiced my hammertoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:25.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还帮我修脚趾甲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can I ever repay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么回报你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:32.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, would you consider naming it the Cooper-Nowitzki Theorem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:32.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能将它命名为库珀诺维斯基理论吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's Nowitzki?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁是诺维斯基？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:38.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm Nowitzki. -Oh, you want me to share credit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:38.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我是诺维斯基 -你要跟我分享荣耀？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.16,0:18:40.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.83,0:18:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.83,0:18:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.37,0:18:47.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey. Hi. RAMONA: Oh, bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.37,0:18:47.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 -去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好姐妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, Dr. Cooper. I'm Kathy O'Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 库珀博士 我是凯西欧布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:18:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just finished reading your paper...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:02.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚看完你用弦网路浓缩理论解释
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:01.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...reconciling the black hole information paradox...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:06.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with your theory of string-network condensates, and it took my breath away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:06.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}黑洞信息悖论的论文 它真的是让我无法呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:11.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe when I publish it, I'll include an inhaler.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:11.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我正式出版时会附上气管喷剂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:16.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you possibly have any time for me to pick your brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:16.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有空跟我聊聊你的想法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see. Today's Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我看看 今天是星期四 星期四晚上我吃吉安康莫的披萨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thursday nights I eat pizza from Giacomo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sausage, mushrooms, light olives. -Great. I'll bring it to your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-香肠 蘑菇 淡味橄榄 -太棒了 我会带披萨到你家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.29,0:19:26.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have the address.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.29,0:19:26.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你的住址
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:31.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:31.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是个好女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, do you see what just happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你知道发生了什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:39.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. I'm getting a free pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:39.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我可以吃到免费的披萨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:43.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我运气正旺
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:51.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-More pad thai, please. -Sheldon, you've already had four servings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:51.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我还要泰式炒河粉 谢谢 -谢尔顿 你已经吃了四份
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:53.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You might wanna slow down a bit, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:53.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你得吃慢一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:56.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just one more bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.19,0:19:56.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再一口就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:10.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, are you okay? -I'm just so fu-- Full.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:10.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 你没事吧？ -我好饱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:19.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[YELPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.14,0:20:22.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's it. No more Thai food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.14,0:20:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}够了 不吃泰餐了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 郑伟
